 "nodes": {
  "-1901436921": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Didn’t think you’d actually show up. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "504005442": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    461001996,
    -1422711874,
    2102684856
   ],
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Well, c’mon in, but don’t judge the mess, or I’m kicking you out.",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "461001996": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 504005442,
   "children": [
    847048411,
    1008982062
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Nice place. Real… cozy.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1422711874": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 504005442,
   "children": [
    178502952,
    -1166737118
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Did a tornado hit, or is this just how you live?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "2102684856": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 504005442,
   "children": [
    1227595346,
    750921883
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "I gotta say, wasn’t expecting the pink.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "847048411": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 461001996,
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Yeah, yeah, laugh it up. It’s a shoebox, I know. But hey, rent’s cheap, and I don’t need much.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "178502952": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1422711874,
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Hey, it’s organized chaos, alright? I know where everything is… mostly. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1227595346": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 2102684856,
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expression": 3,
   "expressionName": "Sad",
   "text": "Tch—okay, first off, don’t get any ideas. These were on sale. Dirt cheap. And they’re comfy as hell. That’s it.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1008982062": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 461001996,
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Just a bed, a workbench, and enough space to not trip over my own shit. …Which, okay, I fail at, but still.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1166737118": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1422711874,
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "If you think this is bad, you should see my old garage. Had to dig for my own damn wrenches.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "750921883": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": 2102684856,
   "children": [
    -1827772686,
    -1044741679,
    -1802474243
   ],
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "I mean, what, you think I sleep in my work clothes? That’d be psycho.",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1827772686": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 750921883,
   "children": [
    -1600723774,
    647341726
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Hey, I get it. Comfort over style, right?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1044741679": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 750921883,
   "children": [
    1568211441,
    1639542447
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "Bet you’ve got a whole stash of cute pajamas hidden somewhere.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1802474243": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 750921883,
   "children": [
    -700362904
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "I dunno, Toni. Soft pink? Looks kinda good on you.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-700362904": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1802474243,
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expression": 3,
   "expressionName": "Sad",
   "text": "... I ... It does? ... Um...",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1568211441": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1044741679,
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "You shut your damn mouth. I do not have a stash of cute shit.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1600723774": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1827772686,
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Damn right. Can’t exactly sleep in a grease-stained tank top every night.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "647341726": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1827772686,
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Not that I haven’t tried.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1639542447": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1044741679,
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "…And if I did, you’d never find it.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1414359943": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Anyway, you wanted to see my place? Congrats, you’ve seen it.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1157514296": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "Toni",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Now, unless you’re here to help clean—which you’re not—grab a seat or something. I got beer in the fridge. Probably.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   },
